Value OS_VERSION (.+?)
Value MODEL (\S+)

# The identity lines of "display version" (eNSP Pro AR6700, USG6306F and CE6800, YunShan
# OS 1.25.1.1); one record. AR and USG print "Version" on a line of its own, CE after
# "YunShan OS,". The uptime line names the model as far as the device knows it (an AR
# says only "AR"). Other lines carry nothing modeled.
Start
  ^.*?\bYunShan OS,\s+Version\s+${OS_VERSION}\s*$$
  ^Version\s+${OS_VERSION}\s*$$
  ^\s*HUAWEI\s+${MODEL}\s+uptime is\b.*$$
  ^.*$$
